<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-7dc8ed1c-bf61-4cad-a18e-8f2e29b3ad18@mhtml.blink" /><meta name="description" content="Download your YouTube videos as MP3 or MP4 files for free with one of the fastest and most powerful YouTube to MP3 converters available."><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>YTMP3 - Free YouTube to MP3 Converter</title><link rel="canonical" href="https://app.ytmp3.as/"></head><body><div id="header"><div><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/"><img src="https://app.ytmp3.as/svg/logo.svg" width="100" height="48" alt="YTMP3 Logo"></a></div><div><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/">Home</a><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/faq/">FAQ</a><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/add-on/">Add-On</a></div></div><form autocomplete="off" method="post"><div><label for="v">Please insert a valid YouTube video URL</label></div><div><input id="v" type="text" name="v" placeholder="youtube.com/watch?v=YoU-tuBe_25" autofocus="" required=""><button id="f" type="button">MP3</button><button type="submit">Convert</button></div></form><div id="text"><h1>YouTube to MP3 Converter</h1><p>YTMP3 is your go-to tool for downloading YouTube videos as MP3 or MP4 files. The service is completely free of charge and does not require any registration or additional software. YTMP3 is optimized to work seamlessly on computers, mobile phones, and tablets.</p><p>Another major advantage of our YouTube to MP3 converter is faster conversion times and safe file downloads compared to our competitors. This is possible because YTMP3 runs on its own self-developed software and does not rely on any third-party APIs or external software.</p><p>By using YTMP3, you accept our <a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/terms-of-use/">Terms of Use</a>.</p><p>How to download a YouTube video?</p><ol><li>Go to YouTube and search for a video you would like to download. Copy the video URL from your browser's address bar. Please note: A valid video URL has the following format: youtube.com/watch?v=videoId</li><li>Paste the video URL into our converter above and select a download format. You can choose between MP3 or MP4. If no format is selected, the video will be converted to an MP3 file by default. Click the „Convert” button.</li><li>The conversion process will start. Depending on the length of the video, this may take some time. Once the conversion is finished successfully, you can download the converted file by clicking the „Download” button.</li></ol><p>Thank you for using our YouTube to MP3 Converter.</p></div><div id="footer"><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/contact/">Contact</a><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/copyright-claims/">Copyright Claims</a><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a><a href="https://app.ytmp3.as/terms-of-use/">ToU</a></div></body></html>
